{"quest_id": 6001, "name": "魔界からの招待状", "description": "王子たちの前に、\nオークの剣闘士が姿を見せる。\n彼女の目的とは……。\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "魔界武術大会", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920083, "map_no": 3942, "level": 80, "multiplier": 0.8, "charisma": 25, "exp": 150, "gold": 700, "drops": [{"card": 2, "c": 2}, {"card": 55, "c": 1}, {"item": 1005, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 30, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 960, "attack": 240, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 221, "move_speed": 1000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106320, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 800, "global_id": 799, "phases": [{"hp": 960, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 130, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106336, "race_id": 8, "master_id": 801, "global_id": 800, "condition": 3}], "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 720, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 100, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 146, "move_speed": 1000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106496, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 387, "global_id": 386, "ranged": true, "phases": [{"hp": 720, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 100, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 146, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106512, "race_id": 8, "special_effect_id": 234, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 388, "global_id": 387, "ranged": true, "condition": 3}], "spawn_sec": 66}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4800, "attack": 360, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2108896, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 5, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 30115, "global_id": 3734, "phases": [{"hp": 4800, "attack": 360, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2108928, "race_id": 8, "master_id": 30116, "global_id": 3735, "condition": 3}], "spawn_sec": 130}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "兵士", "text": "――周囲の状況を確認！\n魔物の姿は見当たりません！", "face": "l9a0104f7c904"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、報告にあったような凶悪な魔物は\nどうやらこの場所にはいなかったようですね。"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "それでは、\n調査を終了して帰還の準備を始めましょうか。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "セシリー", "text": "――いや待て。そこにいる奴、\n隠れてないで姿を見せろ。", "face": "u21"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "へぇ……気配を殺していたつもりだったが、\nまさか気づかれてしまうとはね。", "face": "u446"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "さすがは噂の王子とその仲間と言ったところかな。\nわざわざ出向いた甲斐があったというものだ。", "face": "u446"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あれは、オーク……！？\nなぜ、ここに……？", "face": "l56c326368b3a"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "言葉は不要だ……。\n今は只、その武を以て己を語れッ！！\nさあ剣を取るんだ、王子！　オレと勝負をしろ！", "face": "u446"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、すぐに戦いの準備をお願いします！", "face": "l56c326368b3a"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "ふふっ、やるじゃないか、王子。\n60％の力のオレとでさえ、まともに戦える奴は、\nそうそういないぞ。", "face": "u446"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "60%！？\nまさか、さっきのは手を抜いてたとでも言うのですか！？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "ああ、その通りさ……。", "face": "u446"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "もしオレが本気を出して王子を殺しでもしたら、\n魔界武術大会の御偉方から大目玉を食らうんでね。", "face": "u446"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "――魔界武術大会ッ！？\n何ですか、それは！", "face": "l56c326368b3a"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "そう息巻くな、人間の雌よ。\n順を追って説明してやる。とりあえず場所を移そう。", "face": "u446"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "……どうやら今は敵意はないようです。\n王子、とりあえず話だけでも聞いてみましょう。", "face": "u114"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920083_3942", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 35, "y": 318}, {"k": "m", "x": 618, "y": 236, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 547, "y": 253, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 477, "y": 265, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 371, "y": 287, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 267, "y": 280, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 197, "y": 293, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 119, "y": 307, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 416, "y": 369, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 516, "y": 428, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 605, "y": 420, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 687, "y": 423, "id": 210}, {"k": "r", "x": 546, "y": 327, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 487, "y": 345, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 357, "y": 215, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 243, "y": 221, "id": 303}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "Invitation from the Demon Realm", "description_en": "Before the Princes, an Orc gladiator appears. What is her purpose...? Beginner (★1 target: Avg Lv1, 5 units deployed)"}